Package: biggerpicture
Title: Bigger Picture IPD Harmonisation Pipeline
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Taren", "Sanders", email = "taren.sanders@acu.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Dependency manifest for the Bigger Picture targets pipeline.
    This repository is not an R package; this file declares the packages
    required by the pipeline so they can be installed with pak. CI runs in
    the devcontainer's base image and installs any listed package the image
    lacks.
